79,"width":990,"height":225,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b0W","roundness":null,"seed":1607926464,"version":496,"versionNonce":673857856,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1781796652789,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"ETL API for Impact\n- It queries for all status = N/A, Pending, Approved in the past 7 days (7 is arbitrary)\n- Deletes the past 7 days of data in the existing bigquery impact_subid_product)daily_data\n- Puts the just recently queried data\n\nData - list of orders by customers, where we get commission\n\n\n","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"ETL API for Impact\n- It queries for all status = N/A, Pending, Approved in the past 7 days (7 is arbitrary)\n- Deletes the past 7 days of data in the existing bigquery impact_subid_product)daily_data\n- Puts the just recently queried data\n\nData - list of orders by customers, where we get commission\n\n\n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"5t7Ej6MLbDh-DfdlVwdjd","type":"text","x":542.9221031892963,"y":-241.234876498782,"width":869,"height":75,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b0X","roundness":null,"seed":1777824064,"version":304,"versionNonce":224047424,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1781796595222,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Infra changes, just do for impact first\n1. Make new table in fetchers-raw + fetchers-clean + fetchers-event-log\n2. Just reimplement api queries based on integration-credential in adservice db","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Infra changes, just do for impact first\n1. Make new table in fetchers-raw + fetchers-clean + fetchers-event-log\n2. Just reimplement api queries based on integration-credential in adservice db","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"TMzQqZUBEk6XSBFynldof","type":"text","x":619.6440739771353,"y":-111.75076820108825,"width":1375,"height":175,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b0Y","roundness":null,"seed":1197046080,"version":554,"versionNonce":635803968,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1781797572394,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Fetchers framework\nfetchAll loops through SOURCES (amazon-attribution, impact, etc.)\n    fetchSource goes through all the report types (Impact, Awin, the affiliate networks you're workign on will only have one)\n        fetchReport loops through accounts / integration credentials\n            fetchAccount queries all the data - one per integration-credential for Impact\n                - load to raw GCS for record keeping\n                - load into new table in BigQuery fetchers-raw","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Fetchers framework\nfetchAll loops through SOURCES (amazon-attribution, impact, etc.)\n    fetchSource goes through all the report types (Impact, Awin, the affiliate networks you're workign on will only have one)\n        fetchReport loops through accounts / integration credentials\n            fetchAccount queries all the data - one per integration-credential for Impact\n                - load to raw GCS for record keeping\n                - load into new table in BigQuery fetchers-raw","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"8od3J5e6rksPXD_opn3T7","type":"rectangle","x":1734.744320453955,"y":-334.8434169301066,"width":237.60786925890898,"height":61.536021487657706,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":